10. compressed_income_bins - Binned income data simplifies modeling nonlinear trends in income.
11. Citizen (categorical) - Citizenship status affects eligibility and financial trust.
12. Industry and Ethnicity (categorical) - Capture trends and variation in credit card approval across demographics and job sectors.

